<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER THE THIRD ROUND OF LPGA CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER THE THIRD ROUND OF LPGA CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Delaware 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the third round of the LPGA Championship on Saturday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>210 Leta Lindley 72 69 69, Chris Johnson 68 73 69</p>
<p>212 Kim Saiki 68 75 69, Sherri Steinhauer 68 71 73</p>
<p>213 Barb Mucha 68 73 72</p>
<p>215 Judy Dickinson 75 72 68, Trish Johnson 70 73 72, Annika Sorenstam (Sweden) 70 73 72</p>
<p>216 Dawn Coe-Jones (Canada) 70 75 71, Laura Davies (Britain) 67 75 74</p>
<p>217 Donna Andrews 73 71 73</p>
<p>218 Lorie Kane 73 74 71, Nanci Bowen 73 72 73, Dana Dormann 70 73 75</p>
